<title>BRAZIL: Bradesco Jan-Sept nets 551 million reais.</title>
<headline>Bradesco Jan-Sept nets 551 million reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's largest private bank Bradesco issued the following statement on its January-to-September results.</p>
<p>			   Jan-Sept 1996</p>
<p>    Shr profit		0.58 real</p>
<p>    Net profit		551 million</p>
<p>    Net worth		5.31 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>Share figure is provided per lot of 1,000 stocks.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were provided.</p>
<p>-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 55-11-2324411</p>
